      "text": "COMMON THREADS:\n    1. Reason as method: apply philosophical skepticism to sources\n    2. Secular causation: replace divine providence with human action\n    3. Progress narrative: stadial theory (savagery -> barbarism -> civilization)\n    4. Universal history: Europe not unique; China, Persia, India compared\n    5. Source criticism: classical and biblical sources examined critically\n```"
